<title>JAPAN: SDK Engineering to change name to Showa Technos.</title>
<headline>SDK Engineering to change name to Showa Technos.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>SDK Engineering said on Monday that it would change its name to Showa Technos Corp on October 1.</p>
<p>The Osaka-based telecommunications engineering firm said in a statement that it is changing its name to mark the 50th anniversary of its founding.</p>
</text>
